    "rawSnippet": "atha khalu bhagavāṃstasyāṃ velāyāṃ prajñāpāramitāṃ bhāṣate sma | tadyathā - bodhisattvena mahāsattvena samacittena bhavitavyam | sarvasattveṣu maitracittena bhavitavyam | kṛtajñena bhavitavyam | kṛtavedinā ca bhavitavyam | sarvapāpaviratacittena bhavitavyam | idaṃ ca prajñāpāramitāhṛdayamāgrahītavyam - namo ratnatrayāya | namaḥ śākyamunaye tathāgatāya arhate samyaksaṃbuddhāya"
